{
  "_comment": [
    "SYNTHETIC FIXTURE — not a recording of any site.",
    "",
    "The same feed shape as feed.json, but newest-first. It exists to be",
    "adversarial: MangaDex honours order[chapter]=asc and the theme asks for",
    "it, so every other MangaDex fixture here is already in reading order and",
    "a test over one of them would prove nothing about the PLAN §7.2",
    "normalisation.",
    "",
    "This is not a hypothetical shape. order[chapter]=desc is a documented,",
    "supported value; the pages of a multi-request feed are concatenated in",
    "request order and a retry could reorder them; and a chapter with no",
    "number has no defined position in the server's sort at all. The theme",
    "normalises rather than trusting the server, and this is what proves it.",
    "",
    "Why synthetic: PLAN §1.3 and §1.4.",
    "",
    "Deliberate variations exercised by the test:",
    "  - strictly descending chapter numbers, 4 down to 1",
    "  - a decimal (3.5) between 4 and 3, which must land between 3 and 4 and",
    "    not at either end",
    "  - an unnumbered chapter sitting between 3 and 1, which must keep those",
    "    neighbours rather than being flung to one end by a sort",
    "  - volume labels, which must survive onto theme.Chapter.Volume"
  ],
